    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Panel Pencarian & Filter",
      "id": "advanced-search",
      "intro": "Gunakan panel filter samping kanan berukuran 320px untuk mempermudah pencarian Demographic Attribute spesifik berdasarkan kombinasi beberapa kriteria seperti ID, nama atribut, field tag, tipe domain, dan deskripsi.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Menerapkan Filter & Reset",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Filter Id**: Masukkan angka ID atribut (misal `1` atau `10`) untuk pencarian berdasarkan nomor ID unik.\n• **Filter Attribute Name**: Masukkan kata kunci nama atribut (misal `customer` atau `age`). Pencarian bersifat partial match.\n• **Filter Field Tag**: Masukkan kode field tag teknis (misal `CUST_AGE` atau `ACC_TYPE`). Digunakan sebagai referensi rule engine.\n• **Filter Type**: Pilih domain dari dropdown — `MERCHANT` (merah), `ACCOUNT` (kuning), atau `CARD` (biru). Field ini mendukung clearable.\n• **Filter Description**: Masukkan kata kunci deskripsi atribut untuk pencarian berdasarkan penjelasan field.\n• **Reset**: Klik tombol **Reset** untuk mengosongkan seluruh filter, menyembunyikan panel, dan memuat ulang data awal.\n• **Apply Filters**: Klik tombol **Apply Filters** untuk mengeksekusi pencarian. Daftar data akan di-update secara real-time.",
          "color": "#4f46e5",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #cbd5e1;background:#fff;width:260px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#fafafa;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Search Attribute</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Set filters and apply</div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;cursor:pointer;\">✕</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Id</div><div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:8px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:10px;\">🔍</span><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter id\" style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 6px 6px 24px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;outline:none;box-sizing:border-box;\"/></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Attribute Name</div><div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:8px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:10px;\">🔍</span><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter attribute name\" value=\"customer\" style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 6px 6px 24px;border:1.5px solid #4f46e5;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;outline:none;box-sizing:border-box;\"/></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Field Tag</div><div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:8px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:10px;\">🔍</span><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter field tag\" style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 6px 6px 24px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;outline:none;box-sizing:border-box;\"/></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Type</div><div style=\"position:relative;\"><select style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;outline:none;appearance:none;background:#fff;box-sizing:border-box;\"><option value=\"\">Choose type</option><option value=\"MERCHANT\">MERCHANT</option><option value=\"ACCOUNT\">ACCOUNT</option><option value=\"CARD\">CARD</option></select><span style=\"position:absolute;right:8px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);color:#94a3b8;font-size:9px;pointer-events:none;\">▼</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Description</div><div style=\"position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:8px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:10px;\">🔍</span><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Enter description\" style=\"width:100%;padding:6px 6px 6px 24px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:6px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;outline:none;box-sizing:border-box;\"/></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fafafa;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;\">Reset</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:5px;border-radius:6px;background:#4f46e5;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(79,70,229,.3);\">Apply Filters</button></div></div>"
          }
